or: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n            关于El Diviso\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          El Diviso位于慧兰的Pitalito镇，庄园的主人Jose Uribe Lasso为了远离暴力的生活环境，从娜玲珑搬到了Pitalito，于2000年初购得了El Diviso，开始新的生活篇章。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          选择慧兰，是因为肥沃的土壤与健康多样的生态环境，给了Jose信心，只要努力，种咖啡或者其它任何作物都可以很好的生活下去。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QZPe6Sx1X6TK2tJ8QFJ3YUcIF273zIuy1ZU5jFArz9zI185xo4Vyb695rr2K5wRK4AibZ4KzNMxXw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Jose将庄园分割了不同的地块分别给它的3个儿子，让他们选择想种的咖啡品种，鼓励他们自己选择合适的处理加工方式，现在庄园里有种植的品种有瑰夏，爪哇，卡杜拉，粉波旁以及一种叫Bourbon Aji的波旁品种。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Diviso的处理方式\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          从很多的途径获得的信息，我们总结下来它的处理方式有这些环节/点，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n            制作专用的发酵助剂/发酵液，其中有定向分离培养的菌种，以及咖啡果自身的发酵液\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n            鲜果的预发酵（有氧/厌氧或者组合形式）\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n            鲜果去皮后与发酵液的浸渍（厌氧/有氧或者组合形式）\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n            温度冲击（冷/热冲击）\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n            干燥（遮荫/机械）以及干燥分多阶段来调整发酵\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n           能做到非常强的风味（香气）辨识度，同时优质咖啡的果酸还能那么好的呈现，在我看来是很有难度的，有朝一日，我也想做出这样的豆子～\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n   